    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#historyNote": [
      {
        "@value": "Group status: Required in all files which include user defined groups and/or headings (Rule 18)\nAGS 4.1: Group Rule Added - • If the DICT_TYPE is HEADING, there shall be data variables present for DICT_GRP, DICT_HDNG, DICT_STAT, DICT_UNIT, DICT_DTYP and DICT_DESC. • If the DICT_TYPE is GROUP, there shall be data variables present for DICT_GRP and DICT_DESC and the DICT_HDNG, DICT_STAT, DICT_DTYP and DICT_UNIT headings shall contain NULL values. • Data type for data field heading DICT_UNIT shall not be changed from PU."
      }
    ],
